{"id":"20260829T005448.213669860Z-c587e4aa","time":"2026-08-29T00:54:48.21366986Z","session_id":"session-20260829T003802.236153648Z","task_id":"task-1787963882236621025","source":"reviewer","kind":"review.finding","summary":"[f1] blocking: The candidate asserts that the pre-validation confinement check ensures no downstream consumer sees a wider candidate. (internal/workflow/engine.go: runCandidate, immediately after e.validate(ctx, ...) returns) — e.validate runs mutating formatters and deliberately re-reads the diff afterward. The initial check binds only the worker’s original bytes; a formatter can add or modify an unnamed file, and the returned diff is then consumed downstream unchecked. This violates Sensei invariant sensei_code.workflow.context_never_widens_worker_scope. → Reapply confineToPlannedFiles to the diff returned by e.validate before emitting ValidationRun and before prospective/test-edit inspection, audit, Level-1 classification, review, or admission.","payload":{"id":"f1","severity":"blocking","claim":"The candidate asserts that the pre-validation confinement check ensures no downstream consumer sees a wider candidate.","reference":"internal/workflow/engine.go: runCandidate, immediately after e.validate(ctx, ...) returns","reason":"e.validate runs mutating formatters and deliberately re-reads the diff afterward. The initial check binds only the worker’s original bytes; a formatter can add or modify an unnamed file, and the returned diff is then consumed downstream unchecked. This violates Sensei invariant sensei_code.workflow.context_never_widens_worker_scope.","correction":"Reapply confineToPlannedFiles to the diff returned by e.validate before emitting ValidationRun and before prospective/test-edit inspection, audit, Level-1 classification, review, or admission.","proof_gap":"The added tests exercise helper-level diff shapes and source ordering only; none executes the validation path with a formatter that widens the candidate after the first check."}}
{"id":"20260829T005448.213729560Z-5ca37e7e","time":"2026-08-29T00:54:48.21372956Z","session_id":"session-20260829T003802.236153648Z","task_id":"task-1787963882236621025","source":"reviewer","kind":"review.completed","summary":"REVISE: REVISE. Sensei’s current critical invariant says “Shared context explains why a change was asked for and never enlarges what may be changed.” The initial confinement check is correctly placed for the worker-produced diff, but validation mutates the candidate via formatter(s) and re-reads the diff. An unplanned formatter-created path can therefore reach validation evidence, audit, classification, review, and admission without confinement.  (reviewer · via codex · session fresh · candidate a5eb383fb17a)","payload":{"provenance":{"task_id":"task-1787963882236621025","role":"reviewer","provider":"codex","session_id":"session-20260829T003802.236153648Z","session_mode":"fresh","base_sha":"f01592b0f0828605ed254047fc064f41dacc78f2","candidate_digest":"a5eb383fb17a8853","graph_build_commit":"fac399f8225f","at":"2026-08-29T00:54:48.213659401Z"},"decision":"revise","summary":"REVISE. Sensei’s current critical invariant says “Shared context explains why a change was asked for and never enlarges what may be changed.” The initial confinement check is correctly placed for the worker-produced diff, but validation mutates the candidate via formatter(s) and re-reads the diff. An unplanned formatter-created path can therefore reach validation evidence, audit, classification, review, and admission without confinement.","instructions":"In internal/workflow/engine.go, call confineToPlannedFiles(diff, tc.Files) again immediately after e.validate returns its re-read diff and before ValidationRun or any downstream inspection/audit/classification/review. Add an end-to-end test using a formatter that writes an unnamed path and prove refusal names that path.","findings":[{"id":"f1","severity":"blocking","claim":"The candidate asserts that the pre-validation confinement check ensures no downstream consumer sees a wider candidate.","reference":"internal/workflow/engine.go: runCandidate, immediately after e.validate(ctx, ...) returns","reason":"e.validate runs mutating formatters and deliberately re-reads the diff afterward. The initial check binds only the worker’s original bytes; a formatter can add or modify an unnamed file, and the returned diff is then consumed downstream unchecked. This violates Sensei invariant sensei_code.workflow.context_never_widens_worker_scope.","correction":"Reapply confineToPlannedFiles to the diff returned by e.validate before emitting ValidationRun and before prospective/test-edit inspection, audit, Level-1 classification, review, or admission.","proof_gap":"The added tests exercise helper-level diff shapes and source ordering only; none executes the validation path with a formatter that widens the candidate after the first check."}]}}
