unCandidate in internal/workflow/engine.go right after the ModeInspect refusal and before the candidate.changed event; return the error the way that refusal returns.\n  3. Add TestCandidateWiderThanPlanIsRefusedBeforeReview, TestOperationalTestGrantDoesNotExpandPlanScope and TestASuppliedPlanIsNotWidenedByTheCandidate to internal/workflow/engine_test.go, and TestGovernancePathClassificationCannotMaskScopeWidening to internal/workflow/routine_test.go, building unified-diff strings in the tests.\n  4. Run gofmt -l cmd internal, go vet ./..., and go test ./... .\n  consequences: A worker that touches a path the plan did not name no longer reaches validation, audit, review or admission; the plan must be revised and the run repeated. Candidates within their plan behave exactly as before.\n\nCURRENT EVIDENCE\n  candidate diff: 14694 bytes across 4 files\n    internal/workflow/engine.go\n    internal/workflow/engine_test.go\n    internal/workflow/routine_test.go\n    internal/workflow/testedit.go\n  last Sensei audit: pass\n\nSTILL OPEN (this is your work)\n  - [previous worker stopped] candidate did not converge after 3 review cycles\n  - [reviewer] REVISE. Sensei’s current critical invariant says “Shared context explains why a change was asked for and never enlarges what may be changed.” The initial confinement check is correctly placed for the worker-produced diff, but validation mutates the candidate via formatter(s) and re-reads the diff. An unplanned formatter-created path can therefore reach validation evidence, audit, classification, review, and admission without confinement.\n  - [sensei audit] schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\ndecision: pass\navailability: available\ninput_trust: caller_supplied\ndigest: 745387dff343282b97393f819cd19b3d245bbe2a86755f1480e526da6c8a6234\nchanged_files_count: 4\nfindings_count: 0\n\nNo blocking findings found in supplied diff.\n\nThis handover carries no authority. If a step needs a decision, ask for it;\nnothing above grants permission that Sensei has not given.\n","open_findings":[{"id":"f1","severity":"major","claim":"candidate did not converge after 3 review cycles","reference":"previous worker stopped","reason":"left unanswered when Claude handed the candidate on"},{"id":"f2","severity":"major","claim":"REVISE. Sensei’s current critical invariant says “Shared context explains why a change was asked for and never enlarges what may be changed.” The initial confinement check is correctly placed for the worker-produced diff, but validation mutates the candidate via formatter(s) and re-reads the diff. An unplanned formatter-created path can therefore reach validation evidence, audit, classification, review, and admission without confinement.","reference":"reviewer","reason":"left unanswered when Claude handed the candidate on"},{"id":"f3","severity":"major","claim":"schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\ndecision: pass\navailability: available\ninput_trust: caller_supplied\ndigest: 745387dff343282b97393f819cd19b3d245bbe2a86755f1480e526da6c8a6234\nchanged_files_count: 4\nfindings_count: 0\n\nNo blocking findings found in supplied diff.","reference":"sensei audit","reason":"left unanswered when Claude handed the candidate on"}],"cycles_used":3,"cycles_allowed":3}}
