{"id":"20260829T005646.665267144Z-13be6757","time":"2026-08-29T00:56:46.665267144Z","session_id":"session-20260829T003802.236153648Z","task_id":"task-1787963882236621025","source":"reviewer","kind":"output","summary":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_012MLGR97eeSgJus4KiHxpC2\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"f01592b Merge pull request #115 from globulario/fix/unexamined-planned-file-is-not-covered\\nb8349be fix(workflow): no shortcut on the region's counts -- a would-be grant asks every architectural file, because a fully indexed region can still hold a file that alone publishes sufficient=false; counts that describe a different plan fail closed (owner review of 67f68f9, P1)\\n67f68f9 fix(workflow): an exhausted post-authorization gap escalates to the human like every exhausted gap, and impossible region counts (indexed \u003e file_count) fail closed; the probe shortcut requires equality (#115 Codex P1 x2, tenth pass)\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"403f3038-5a27-408b-96f3-16d43628636f\",\"uuid\":\"c160998a-9103-469d-b639-020ee2a35115\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-29T00:56:46.664Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"stdout\":\"f01592b Merge pull request #115 from globulario/fix/unexamined-planned-file-is-not-covered\\nb8349be fix(workflow): no shortcut on the region's counts -- a would-be grant asks every architectural file, because a fully indexed region can still hold a file that alone publishes sufficient=false; counts that describe a different plan fail closed (owner review of 67f68f9, P1)\\n67f68f9 fix(workflow): an exhausted post-authorization gap escalates to the human like every exhausted gap, and impossible region counts (indexed \u003e file_count) fail closed; the probe shortcut requires equality (#115 Codex P1 x2, tenth pass)\",\"stderr\":\"\",\"interrupted\":false,\"isImage\":false,\"noOutputExpected\":false}}","payload":{"stream":"stdout"}}
