{"id":"20260829T010403.299846302Z-468432ff","time":"2026-08-29T01:04:03.299846302Z","session_id":"session-20260829T003802.236153648Z","task_id":"task-1787963882236621025","source":"system","kind":"handoff.created","summary":"Codex did not converge; the candidate and its unanswered findings pass to the next bounded worker","payload":{"provenance":{"task_id":"task-1787963882236621025","role":"implementer","provider":"Codex","session_mode":"fresh","base_sha":"f01592b0f0828605ed254047fc064f41dacc78f2","graph_build_commit":"fac399f8225f","at":"2026-08-29T01:04:03.299740881Z"},"previous_worker":"Codex","state":"CONTINUING AN EXISTING TASK. This is not a fresh start.\n\nA previous worker (Codex) already worked in this candidate. Its changes are present.\nContinue from them. Do not start over, and do not re-solve what is already solved.\n\nTASK IDENTITY\n  task: task-1787963882236621025\n  request: A candidate is confined to the files its plan names: after the worker's diff is read and before validation, audit, review or admission, every changed path -- added, modified, deleted or renamed -- must be one the plan named; any other path refuses the candidate, and no test-edit grant enlarges the named set.\n  domain: github.com/globulario/sensei-code\n  base commit: f01592b0f0828605ed254047fc064f41dacc78f2\n  candidate branch: sensei-code/task-1787963882236621025\n  phase reached: revising\n  workers so far: claude → codex\n\nARCHITECTURAL CONTRACT (the bound you may not widen)\n  why: A candidate is confined to the files its plan names: after the worker's diff is read and before validation, audit, review or admission, every changed path -- added, modified, deleted or renamed -- must be one the plan named; any other path refuses the candidate, and no test-edit grant enlarges the named set.\n  1. Add the confinement check function in internal/workflow/testedit.go: input the diff and the plan's named files; output an error naming every path outside the plan, or nil.\n  2. Call it